# Jupyter
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Keys, certificates, provisioning profiles.
# gitleaks (pre-commit + CI) catches PEM-armoured private keys by their header,
# but a DER/PKCS#12 bundle is binary and carries no such marker — so the
# container formats have to be kept out by name. `make-signing-cert.sh` writes
# its key.pem/cert.pem/identity.p12 into a mktemp dir it deletes on exit; these
# patterns cover the copies people make by hand while debugging signing.
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.cer
*.crt
*.der
*.p8
*.jks
*.keystore
*.mobileprovision
*.provisionprofile
id_rsa
id_ecdsa
id_ed25519
